  "pages": [
    {
      "page_id": "p01",
      "text": "At dawn Omar sits on the lawn to draw a hawk.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_070/pages/p01.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_070/audio/pages/p01.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 3813,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_070/audio/song/p01.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 5302
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p02",
      "text": "The hawk sits on a post and yawns. Omar draws its claws and beak.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_070/pages/p02.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_070/audio/pages/p02.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 5877,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_070/audio/song/p02.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 6922
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p03",
      "text": "Then the hawk lifts off. \"I saw its claws, but I did not draw its legs!\" Omar says.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_070/pages/p03.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_070/audio/pages/p03.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8411,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_070/audio/song/p03.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 9351
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p04",
      "text": "Omar hauls bread out to the lawn. \"Sit, hawk, and I will draw you!\"",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_070/pages/p04.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_070/audio/pages/p04.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6190,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_070/audio/song/p04.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 6974
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p05",
      "text": "A gull lands first. It squawks, grabs the bread and hauls it off the lawn.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_070/pages/p05.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_070/audio/pages/p05.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6399,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_070/audio/song/p05.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7993
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p06",
      "text": "A cat crawls out of the straw. The bread is gone! It yawns and crawls off.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_070/pages/p06.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_070/audio/pages/p06.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 7079,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_070/audio/song/p06.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7915
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p07",
      "text": "Then a big dog runs over the lawn and over Omar's drawing. Muddy paws on the hawk!",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_070/pages/p07.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_070/audio/pages/p07.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 7732,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_070/audio/song/p07.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 9247
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p08",
      "text": "Omar's jaw drops. \"I thought it was a hawk. Now it is a mess of paw marks!\"",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_070/pages/p08.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_070/audio/pages/p08.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6765,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_070/audio/song/p08.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7915
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p09",
      "text": "Omar picks up his pen. He draws a jaw and claws on the paw marks. Now a beast crawls over the lawn!",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_070/pages/p09.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_070/audio/pages/p09.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8620,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_070/audio/song/p09.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 11075
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p10",
      "text": "Dad pins it up. \"The hawk is my bit,\" Omar says. \"The jaw, the claws and the paws? All dog.\"",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_070/pages/p10.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_070/audio/pages/p10.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 9456,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
